<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-CATALONIA GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-CATALONIA GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>MONTMELO, Spain 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading qualifying times</p>
<p>after Saturday's final practice session for Sunday's 500cc</p>
<p>motorcycling Grand Prix of Catalonia:</p>
<p> 1. Michael Doohan (Honda) Australia     1 minute 46:201 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Alex Criville (Honda) Spain		     1:46.309</p>
<p> 3. Luca Cadalora (Honda) Italy		     1:46.442</p>
<p> 4. Carlos Checa (Honda) Spain			1:46.512</p>
<p> 5. Jean-Michel Bayle (Yamaha) France	     1:46.837</p>
